@startuml

title UzAvto-Oson **communication** diagram

participant CardHolder
participant UzAvto
participant Oson
participant Uzcard
participant Munis

== Authorization ==

autonumber

UzAvto ->o Oson: Auth Request (username, password)
Oson --> UzAvto: Auth Response (token)

== Check Payment ==

autonumber

CardHolder --> UzAvto: Enter card pan and expiry

UzAvto ->o Oson: CheckRequest(pan, expiry, token)
Oson -> Uzcard: ValidCardRequest(pan)
Oson <-- Uzcard: ValidCardResponse(OK)
UzAvto <-- Oson: CheckResponse(tranId)

CardHolder <-- UzAvto: Direct user to sms entry page

== Confirm Payment ==
autonumber

CardHolder <-- Oson: SendConfirmationCmsCode(code)
UzAvto <-- CardHolder: Enter sms code and accept (code)

UzAvto ->o Oson: ConfirmationRequest(code, tranId,token)
Oson -> Uzcard: DebitRequest(pan, amount)
Oson <-- Uzcard: DebitResponse(OK)
Oson -> Munis: Inform about payment(???)
Oson <-- Munis: Payment registered(OK)
UzAvto <-- Oson: ConfirmationResponse(OK)

@enduml
